flowchart TD
    A[Start ETL Runner] --> B[Scan YAML Configuration Directories]

    B --> C{Configuration Type}
    C -->|Import YAML| D[Load Import Configuration]
    C -->|Export YAML| E[Load Export Configuration]

    D --> F{load_file_flag = Y?}
    F -->|No| G[Skip Configuration]
    F -->|Yes| H[Read Module Registries]

    H --> I[Build Extract Modules]
    I --> J[Resolve Python Class from Registry]
    J --> K[Instantiate Module with YAML Rules]
    K --> L[Run Extract Modules]
    L --> M[Raw Data Loaded into DataFrame]

    M --> N[Build Transform Modules]
    N --> O[Run Transform Modules in YAML Order]
    O --> P[Apply Configured Transformations]

    P --> Q[Examples]
    Q --> Q1[Map or Rename Columns]
    Q --> Q2[Clean Headers]
    Q --> Q3[Filter Rows]
    Q --> Q4[Remove Spaces]
    Q --> Q5[Add File Year and Month]

    Q1 --> R[Transformed DataFrame]
    Q2 --> R
    Q3 --> R
    Q4 --> R
    Q5 --> R

    R --> S[Build Load Modules]
    S --> T[Write Staging File]
    T --> U[Generate BCP Loader Batch File]
    U --> V[Execute BCP Load]
    V --> W[Load Data into Target Database]

    E --> X{export_data_flag = Y?}
    X -->|No| G
    X -->|Yes| Y[Read Export Module Registry]
    Y --> Z[Build Export Modules]
    Z --> AA[Generate BCP Export Batch File]
    AA --> AB[Execute BCP Export]
    AB --> AC[Write Exported Data File]

    W --> AD[Print Success or Failure]
    AC --> AD
    G --> AD
    AD --> AE[Continue to Next YAML Configuration]
    AE --> AF[End]

    subgraph YAML_Driven_Configuration[What the YAML Controls]
        Y1[Source File or Database Connection]
        Y2[Extract Module Sequence]
        Y3[Transformation Module Sequence]
        Y4[Module-Specific Rules]
        Y5[Staging Output Path]
        Y6[Target Database Connection]
        Y7[BCP Settings]
    end

    subgraph Module_Architecture[Module Architecture]
        M1[Extract Modules]
        M2[Transform Modules]
        M3[Load Modules]
        M4[Export Modules]
        M5[Module Registries map YAML names to Python classes]
    end

    B -. reads .-> YAML_Driven_Configuration
    H -. uses .-> Module_Architecture
    Y -. uses .-> Module_Architecture
